on Viewer and Analyzer extracting biological knowledge from transcriptome data of prokaryotes</article-title><source>Bioinformatics</source><year>2007</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>1161</fpage><lpage>1163</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17237043</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/bioinformatics/btl658</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Scheer</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Klawonn</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Munch</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Grote</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Hiller</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Choi</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Koch</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Schobert</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Hartig</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Klages</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Jahn</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>JProGO: a novel tool for the functional interpretation of prokaryotic microarray data using Gene Ontology information</article-title><source>Nucleic Acids Res</source><year>2006</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>W510</fpage><lpage>5</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16845060</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/nar/gkl329</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Awad</surname><given-names>IA</given-names></name><name><surname>Rees</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>Hernandez-Boussard</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Ball</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>Sherlock</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Caryoscop